### ===== CATEGORIA =====

### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categorias HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener categoria por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categorias/9 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear categoria
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categorias HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "nombre_categoria": "Torta vegana"
}

### Actualizar categoria
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/categorias/9 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "nombre_categoria": "Torta vegana nivel 5"
}

### Eliminar categoria
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/categorias/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ===== PRODUCTOS =====

### Listar productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/producto HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener producto por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/producto/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear producto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/producto HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Toyota",
    "color": "Rojo",
    "categoria": { "idCategoria": 1 }
}

### Actualizar vehiculo
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/producto/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
content-type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Toyota",
    "color": "Azul",
    "categoria": { "idCategoria": 1 }
}

### Eliminar vehiculo
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/producto/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
